      "label": "1. Ekstraksi Dinamika 2 Hz & Tahap 1 KNN (Bab III Subbab 3.2 - 3.3.1)"
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 1540,
      "height": 300,
      "label": "2. Tahap 2: Dynamic Trajectory Alignment & Penalti BJC (Bab III Subbab 3.3.2)"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 290,
      "label": "3. Seleksi Komposit & Output Playlist Mood-Arc"
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 1. Time-Series DEAM 2 Hz\n`[Bab III 3.2]`\n\n- 1.802 klip audio (45 detik)\n- Buang 15s awal (transien)\n- Ambil **30s stabil** (detik 15–45, **60 timestamp**)"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 2. Ekstraksi Intro & Outro\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.3]`\n\n- **Intro** $\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{intro},k}$: rata-rata 6 titik awal (15–18s)\n- **Outro** $\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{outro},k}$: rata-rata 6 titik akhir (42–45s)\n- Vektor $\\vec{\\mathbf{t}}_k = \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{outro}} - \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{intro}}$ & $\\theta_k$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 810,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### 3. Interpolasi Waypoint\n`[Bab III 3.3.1, Eq. 3.1]`\n\n- Input $\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{start}}$, $\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{target}}$, panjang $M$\n- Hitung $M$ titik acuan linier:\n  $$\\mathbf{w}_j = \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{start}} + \\frac{j-1}{M-1}(\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{target}} - \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{start}})$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 4. Tahap 1: KNN Retrieval\n`[Bab III 3.3.1, Eq. 3.2]`\n\n- Query KD-Tree pada $\\bar{\\mathbf{p}}_k$\n- Hitung $d_{\\mathrm{target}}(\\mathbf{w}_j, \\bar{\\mathbf{p}}_k) = \\|\\mathbf{w}_j - \\bar{\\mathbf{p}}_k\\|_2$\n- Ambil **$K = 20$ kandidat** terdekat"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 5. Vektor Target Lintasan\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.4]`\n\n- Arah perubahan emosi yang diharapkan antar-waypoint:\n  $$\\vec{\\mathbf{u}}_j = \\mathbf{w}_j - \\mathbf{w}_{j-1}$$\n- Menjadi acuan arah gerak lagu"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 6. Penyelarasan Arah Trajektori\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.5]`\n\n- Cosine similarity antara gerak internal lagu $\\vec{\\mathbf{t}}_k$ & arah lintasan $\\vec{\\mathbf{u}}_j$:\n  $$\\mathrm{Sim}_{\\mathrm{traj}} = \\frac{\\vec{\\mathbf{t}}_k \\cdot \\vec{\\mathbf{u}}_j}{\\|\\vec{\\mathbf{t}}_k\\|_2 \\|\\vec{\\mathbf{u}}_j\\|_2} \\in [-1, +1]$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### 7. Penalti Boundary Jump Cost\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.6 — Wang 2024 REMAST]`\n\n- Jarak fisik antara penutup lagu sebelumnya $L_{j-1}$ & pembuka kandidat $L_k$:\n  $$\\mathcal{BJC}(L_{j-1}, L_k) = \\|\\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{outro}}(L_{j-1}) - \\mathbf{p}_{\\mathrm{intro}}(L_k)\\|_2$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 8. Skor Komposit Reranker\n`[Bab III 3.3.2, Eq. 3.7]`\n\n- Gabung 3 komponen dengan bobot $w_1 + w_2 + w_3 = 1$:\n  - Jarak waypoint ($w_1$)\n  - Ketidakselarasan arah ($w_2$)\n  - Penalti $\\mathcal{BJC}$ ($w_3$)"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 9. Seleksi Kandidat Terbaik\n\n- Pilih kandidat $L_k^*$ dengan **Score terendah**\n- Dekat waypoint + searah lintasan + sambungan *outro-intro* halus"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 10. Iterasi Posisi j = 1..M\n\n- Simpan $L_k^*$ ke playlist\n- Ulangi untuk waypoint $\\mathbf{w}_{j+1}$ hingga panjang $M \\in \\{5, 10, 15\\}$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 11. Output Playlist Mood-Arc\n\n- Siap dievaluasi dengan metrik $\\mathcal{S}$, $\\mathcal{E}$, $\\mathcal{CBJC}$ & *Blind A/B*"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
